msgid ""
"The A3 PD configuration in this guide uses DP2/TP8 on the Prefill node and\n"
"DP16/TP1 on the Decode node. Prefill runs in eager mode with FlashComm1, while\n"
"Decode uses `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph mode and keeps FlashComm1 disabled."
msgstr ""
"本指南中的 A3 PD 配置在 Prefill 节点上使用 DP2/TP8，在 Decode 节点上使用\n"
"DP16/TP1。Prefill 以 eager 模式运行并启用 FlashComm1，而\n"
"Decode 使用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 图模式并保持 FlashComm1 禁用。"

msgid ""
"The A2 PD configuration in this guide uses DP2/TP8 across two Prefill\n"
"nodes and DP8/TP2 across two Decode nodes. Prefill runs in eager mode,\n"
"while Decode uses `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph mode and keeps FlashComm1\n"
"disabled."
msgstr ""
"本指南中的 A2 PD 配置在两个 Prefill 节点上使用 DP2/TP8，\n"
"在两个 Decode 节点上使用 DP8/TP2。Prefill 以 eager 模式运行，\n"
"而 Decode 使用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 图模式并保持 FlashComm1\n"
"禁用。"

msgid ""
"GLM-5.3-Flash model currently supports only model runner V1 on Ascend, so\n"
"all A3 scripts set `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0` explicitly."
msgstr ""
"GLM-5.3-Flash 模型目前在昇腾上仅支持 model runner V1，因此\n"
"所有 A3 脚本都显式设置 `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0`。"

msgid ""
"Experimental SFA context parallelism can be enabled with\n"
"`--additional-config '{\"enable_dsa_cp\": true}'`. It shards SFA query tokens\n"
"within the tensor parallel group and keeps the main KV, indexer pool, and tail\n"
"caches replicated. KDA continues to use its existing tensor parallel path.\n"
"Keep both prefill context parallel size and decode context parallel size at 1."
msgstr ""
"可通过 `--additional-config '{\"enable_dsa_cp\": true}'` 启用实验性的 SFA 上下文并行。\n"
"它会在张量并行组内对 SFA query token 进行分片，并保持主 KV、indexer pool 和 tail\n"
"缓存为副本形式。KDA 继续使用其现有的张量并行路径。\n"
"请将 prefill context parallel size 和 decode context parallel size 均保持为 1。"

msgid ""
"- `GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8-mxfp8 (950DT Products mxfp8 Quantized)`: requires 1 950DT Products (96GB × 8) node.[Download model weight](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-Tech/GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8-mxfp8).\n"
"- `GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8`: requires 1 Atlas 800 A3 (128GB × 8) node for\n"
"  single-node deployment, or 2 nodes for 1P1D PD disaggregated deployment.\n"
"  [Download model weight](https://modelers.cn/models/Eco-Tech/GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8).\n"
"- `GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8`: requires 2 Atlas 800 A2 (64GB × 8) nodes.[Download model weight](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-Tech/GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8)."
msgstr ""
"- `GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8-mxfp8（Ascend 950DT系列产品 mxfp8 量化）`：需要 1 个 Ascend 950DT系列产品（96GB × 8）节点。[下载模型权重](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-Tech/GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8-mxfp8)。\n"
"- `GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8`：单节点部署需要 1 个 Atlas 800 A3（128GB × 8）节点，\n"
"  1P1D PD 分离部署需要 2 个节点。\n"
"  [下载模型权重](https://modelers.cn/models/Eco-Tech/GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8)。\n"
"- `GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8`：需要 2 个 Atlas 800 A2（64GB × 8）节点。[下载模型权重](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-Tech/GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8)。"

msgid "- You can use our official docker image to run GLM-5.3-Flash directly."
msgstr "- 您可以使用我们的官方 docker 镜像直接运行 GLM-5.3-Flash。"

msgid ""
"- `--data-parallel-size 1`: Runs a single DP rank. `--tensor-parallel-size` is 8 on 950DT Products and 16 on Atlas 800 A3. This layout is recommended to balance memory capacity and compute efficiency for the w8a8 weights.\n"
"- `--enable-expert-parallel`: Must be enabled for the MoE architecture of GLM-5.3-Flash.\n"
"- `--quantization ascend`: Enables Ascend quantization for the w8a8 quantized weights.\n"
"- `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\": \"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'`: Enables graph capture for the decode phase only, improving decode performance by reducing kernel launch overhead.\n"
"- `--limit-mm-per-prompt '{\"image\": 1, \"video\": 0}'`: For text-only deployment, --limit-mm-per-prompt can be omitted. For multimodal deployment, configure this parameter according to the actual request shape. For example, use --limit-mm-per-prompt '{\"image\":2,\"video\":0}' for two-image requests, and use --limit-mm-per-prompt '{\"image\":0,\"video\":1}' for one-video requests.\n"
"- `--speculative-config`: Enables Multi-Token Prediction (MTP) speculative decoding with the DeepSeek-style MTP draft head of GLM-5.3-Flash. The single-node examples use three speculative tokens on 950DT Products and five on Atlas 800 A3. `enforce_eager: true` keeps the MTP draft model in eager mode because GLM-5.3-Flash does not support graph-mode speculative decoding."
msgstr ""
"- `--data-parallel-size 1`：运行单个 DP rank。`--tensor-parallel-size` 在 Ascend 950DT系列产品上为 8，在 Atlas 800 A3 上为 16。推荐使用此布局，以平衡 w8a8 权重的显存容量与计算效率。\n"
"- `--enable-expert-parallel`：针对 GLM-5.3-Flash 的 MoE 架构必须启用。\n"
"- `--quantization ascend`：为 w8a8 量化权重启用昇腾量化。\n"
"- `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\": \"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'`：仅对 decode 阶段启用图捕获，通过减少 kernel 启动开销来提升 decode 性能。\n"
"- `--limit-mm-per-prompt '{\"image\": 1, \"video\": 0}'`：对于纯文本部署，可省略 --limit-mm-per-prompt。对于多模态部署，请根据实际请求形态配置此参数。例如，对于双图请求使用 --limit-mm-per-prompt '{\"image\":2,\"video\":0}'，对于单视频请求使用 --limit-mm-per-prompt '{\"image\":0,\"video\":1}'。\n"
"- `--speculative-config`：使用 GLM-5.3-Flash 的 DeepSeek 风格 MTP draft head 启用 Multi-Token Prediction（MTP）投机解码。单节点示例在 Ascend 950DT系列产品上使用三个投机 token，在 Atlas 800 A3 上使用五个。`enforce_eager: true` 使 MTP draft 模型保持 eager 模式，因为 GLM-5.3-Flash 不支持图模式投机解码。"

msgid "### 5.2 1P1D PD Disaggregated Deployment"
msgstr "### 5.2 1P1D PD 分离部署"

msgid ""
"Both A3 and A2 deployments use the same `launch_online_dp.py` script to\n"
"start one vLLM process per local DP rank. Save it on every Prefill and Decode\n"
"node before following the platform-specific instructions below."
msgstr ""
"A3 和 A2 部署均使用相同的 `launch_online_dp.py` 脚本，\n"
"为每个本地 DP rank 启动一个 vLLM 进程。在按照下方针对具体平台的说明操作之前，\n"
"请将其保存到每个 Prefill 和 Decode 节点上。"

msgid "#### 5.2.1 Prepare the DP Launcher"
msgstr "#### 5.2.1 准备 DP 启动器"

msgid ""
"The launcher passes visible devices, engine port, global DP size, DP rank, DP\n"
"address, DP RPC port, and TP size to each role script as `$1` through `$7`."
msgstr ""
"启动器会将可见设备、引擎端口、全局 DP size、DP rank、DP\n"
"地址、DP RPC 端口和 TP size 作为 `$1` 到 `$7` 传递给各角色脚本。"

msgid ""
"This example uses two Atlas 800 A3 servers. The Prefill node runs two\n"
"    DP ranks with TP8 (DP2/TP8), and the Decode node runs sixteen DP ranks\n"
"    with TP1 (DP16/TP1). Both layouts consume all 16 logical devices on their\n"
"    respective servers. `MooncakeConnectorV2` transfers KV cache from the\n"
"    Prefill engines to the Decode engines."
msgstr ""
"本示例使用两台 Atlas 800 A3 服务器。Prefill 节点运行两个\n"
"    DP rank，TP8（DP2/TP8），Decode 节点运行十六个 DP rank，\n"
"    TP1（DP16/TP1）。两种布局都会占用各自服务器上的全部 16 个逻辑设备。\n"
"    `MooncakeConnectorV2` 将 KV cache 从\n"
"    Prefill 引擎传输到 Decode 引擎。"

msgid ""
"Before starting the services, replace `LOCAL_IP`, `NIC_NAME`, and\n"
"    `MODEL_PATH` in the following scripts with values for the deployment\n"
"    environment."
msgstr ""
"在启动服务之前，请将以下脚本中的 `LOCAL_IP`、`NIC_NAME` 和\n"
"    `MODEL_PATH` 替换为部署环境的实际值。"

msgid "**A3 Serving Scripts and Startup Commands**"
msgstr "**A3 服务脚本与启动命令**"

msgid "**Start the Prefill node**"
msgstr "**启动 Prefill 节点**"

msgid ""
"On the Prefill node, save the following script as `run_p.sh`. The launcher\n"
"    passes the visible devices, API port, DP configuration, and TP size as\n"
"    positional arguments."
msgstr ""
"在 Prefill 节点上，将以下脚本保存为 `run_p.sh`。启动器\n"
"    会将可见设备、API 端口、DP 配置和 TP size 作为\n"
"    位置参数传递。"

msgid ""
"Start two DP2/TP8 Prefill engines. `--dp-address` uses the Prefill node IP.\n"
"    The launcher assigns API ports `9081-9082`."
msgstr ""
"启动两个 DP2/TP8 Prefill 引擎。`--dp-address` 使用 Prefill 节点 IP。\n"
"    启动器会分配 API 端口 `9081-9082`。"

msgid "**Start the Decode Node**"
msgstr "**启动 Decode 节点**"

msgid ""
"On the Decode node, save the following script as `run_d.sh`. Decode uses\n"
"    `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph mode for the target model. FlashComm1 remains\n"
"    disabled by default."
msgstr ""
"在 Decode 节点上，将以下脚本保存为 `run_d.sh`。Decode 对目标模型\n"
"    使用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 图模式。FlashComm1 默认\n"
"    保持禁用。"

msgid ""
"Start sixteen DP16/TP1 Decode engines. `--dp-address` uses the Decode node\n"
"    IP. The launcher assigns API ports `9900-9915`."
msgstr ""
"启动十六个 DP16/TP1 Decode 引擎。`--dp-address` 使用 Decode 节点\n"
"    IP。启动器会分配 API 端口 `9900-9915`。"

msgid "**Deploy the PD Proxy**"
msgstr "**部署 PD 代理**"

msgid ""
"After all Prefill and Decode engines are ready, open another terminal in\n"
"    the Prefill container and start the\n"
"    [load-balancing proxy](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py).\n"
"    The proxy listens on port `8081`, distributes requests across Prefill\n"
"    endpoints `9081-9082`, and then forwards Decode work to endpoints\n"
"    `9900-9915`."
msgstr ""
"在所有 Prefill 和 Decode 引擎就绪后，在\n"
"    Prefill 容器中打开另一个终端并启动\n"
"    [负载均衡代理](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py)。\n"
"    该代理监听端口 `8081`，将请求分发到 Prefill\n"
"    端点 `9081-9082`，然后将 Decode 工作转发到端点\n"
"    `9900-9915`。"

msgid "**Key Parameter Descriptions**"
msgstr "**关键参数说明**"

msgid ""
"- `--data-parallel-size` and `--tensor-parallel-size` define DP2/TP8 on\n"
"      Prefill and DP16/TP1 on Decode. Their product must be 16 on each A3 node.\n"
"    - `--data-parallel-address` and `--data-parallel-rpc-port` coordinate DP\n"
"      ranks within one role. Prefill and Decode use their respective node IPs.\n"
"      The default RPC port `12325` can be reused because the roles run on\n"
"      different hosts.\n"
"    - `--vllm-start-port 9081` assigns API ports `9081-9082` on Prefill, while\n"
"      `--vllm-start-port 9900` assigns `9900-9915` on Decode. All endpoints\n"
"      must be reachable from the proxy.\n"
"    - Both roles use a maximum model length of `133120` and MTP speculative\n"
"      decoding with five speculative tokens. `enforce_eager` in the\n"
"      speculative configuration keeps the MTP draft model in eager mode.\n"
"    - `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0` explicitly selects model runner V1 on both\n"
"      roles for this validated configuration.\n"
"    - Prefill uses `--max-num-seqs 32` and\n"
"      `--max-num-batched-tokens 8192`. Decode uses `--max-num-seqs 10` and\n"
"      `--max-num-batched-tokens 60`. Tune these role-specific scheduler limits\n"
"      independently for the target workload.\n"
"    - `MooncakeConnectorV2` transfers KV cache between the two roles.\n"
"      `kv_role` must be `kv_producer` on Prefill and `kv_consumer` on Decode.\n"
"      The role-specific KV ports must be available on their respective hosts.\n"
"    - Prefill uses `--enforce-eager` for the target model and explicitly\n"
"      enables FlashComm1 with `enable_flashcomm1: true`. Decode leaves\n"
"      FlashComm1 disabled and uses `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` for the target model.\n"
"    - `multistream_overlap_shared_expert: true` overlaps shared-expert and\n"
"      routed-expert work. CPU binding remains enabled by default on both roles;\n"
"      Decode additionally enables the static kernel in\n"
"      `ascend_compilation_config`.\n"
"    - `HCCL_IF_IP` and all socket interface variables must select the service\n"
"      network used by the configured node IPs. The DP RPC, engine, Mooncake,\n"
"      and proxy ports must be allowed by the host firewall."
msgstr ""
"- `--data-parallel-size` 和 `--tensor-parallel-size` 在 Prefill 上定义 DP2/TP8，在 Decode 上定义 DP16/TP1。在每个 A3 节点上，它们的乘积必须为 16。\n"
"    - `--data-parallel-address` 和 `--data-parallel-rpc-port` 用于协调同一角色内的 DP rank。Prefill 和 Decode 使用各自的节点 IP。\n"
"      由于两个角色运行在不同的主机上，可以复用默认的 RPC 端口 `12325`。\n"
"    - `--vllm-start-port 9081` 在 Prefill 上分配 API 端口 `9081-9082`，而\n"
"      `--vllm-start-port 9900` 在 Decode 上分配 `9900-9915`。所有端点\n"
"      必须能够从代理访问。\n"
"    - 两个角色都使用最大模型长度 `133120`，并采用带有五个推测 token 的 MTP 推测解码。推测配置中的 `enforce_eager` 使 MTP 草稿模型保持在 eager 模式。\n"
"    - `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0` 在此已验证配置中显式地在两个角色上选择 model runner V1。\n"
"    - Prefill 使用 `--max-num-seqs 32` 和\n"
"      `--max-num-batched-tokens 8192`。Decode 使用 `--max-num-seqs 10` 和\n"
"      `--max-num-batched-tokens 60`。请根据目标工作负载独立调整这些角色特定的调度器限制。\n"
"    - `MooncakeConnectorV2` 在两个角色之间传输 KV cache。\n"
"      `kv_role` 在 Prefill 上必须为 `kv_producer`，在 Decode 上必须为 `kv_consumer`。\n"
"      角色特定的 KV 端口必须在各自的主机上可用。\n"
"    - Prefill 对目标模型使用 `--enforce-eager`，并通过 `enable_flashcomm1: true` 显式启用 FlashComm1。Decode 保持 FlashComm1 禁用，并对目标模型使用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY`。\n"
"    - `multistream_overlap_shared_expert: true` 使共享专家和路由专家的工作重叠。CPU 绑定在两个角色上默认保持启用；\n"
"      Decode 还在 `ascend_compilation_config` 中启用静态内核。\n"
"    - `HCCL_IF_IP` 和所有 socket 接口变量必须选择配置的节点 IP 所使用的服务网络。DP RPC、引擎、Mooncake 和代理端口必须被主机防火墙允许。"

msgid "=== \"Atlas 800 A2 series\""
msgstr "=== \"Atlas 800 A2系列\""

msgid ""
"This example uses four Atlas 800 A2 (64GB × 8) servers: two Prefill\n"
"    nodes running one DP rank with TP8 each (DP2/TP8 in total), and two\n"
"    Decode nodes running four DP ranks with TP2 each (DP8/TP2 in total).\n"
"    Each rank consumes all eight devices on its server.\n"
"    `MooncakeConnectorV2` transfers KV cache from the Prefill engines to the\n"
"    Decode engines. The topology names the two Prefill nodes P0/P1 and the\n"
"    two Decode nodes D0/D1. P0 serves the Prefill API endpoint; P1 is\n"
"    headless. The proxy addresses the API endpoints on both Decode nodes."
msgstr ""
"本示例使用四台 Atlas 800 A2（64GB × 8）服务器：两个 Prefill\n"
"    节点各运行一个 DP rank，每个使用 TP8（总计 DP2/TP8），以及两个\n"
"    Decode 节点各运行四个 DP rank，每个使用 TP2（总计 DP8/TP2）。\n"
"    每个 rank 占用其服务器上的全部八个设备。\n"
"    `MooncakeConnectorV2` 将 KV cache 从 Prefill 引擎传输到\n"
"    Decode 引擎。该拓扑将两个 Prefill 节点命名为 P0/P1，将\n"
"    两个 Decode 节点命名为 D0/D1。P0 提供 Prefill API 端点；P1 为\n"
"    无头节点。代理访问两个 Decode 节点上的 API 端点。"

msgid ""
"The shared `launch_online_dp.py` launcher from Section 5.2.1 starts the\n"
"    engines on all four nodes. Save the common serving templates below and the\n"
"    node-specific wrapper scripts on their respective nodes. Replace all IP,\n"
"    NIC, and model-path placeholders."
msgstr ""
"来自第 5.2.1 节的共享 `launch_online_dp.py` 启动器会在所有四个节点上启动\n"
"    引擎。将下面的通用服务模板和\n"
"    节点特定的包装脚本保存到各自的节点上。替换所有 IP、\n"
"    NIC 和模型路径占位符。"

msgid "**Common Prefill template**"
msgstr "**通用 Prefill 模板**"

msgid ""
"Save the following script as `run_p.sh` on P0 and P1. The node wrappers\n"
"    below provide `LOCAL_IP` and the API/headless role."
msgstr ""
"将以下脚本保存为 P0 和 P1 上的 `run_p.sh`。下面的节点包装脚本\n"
"    提供 `LOCAL_IP` 以及 API/无头角色。"

msgid "**P0 and P1 wrappers**"
msgstr "**P0 和 P1 包装脚本**"

msgid ""
"Save the following `run_p0.sh` on P0. P0 hosts the Prefill API endpoint."
msgstr "将以下 `run_p0.sh` 保存到 P0。P0 承载 Prefill API 端点。"

msgid "Save the following `run_p1.sh` on P1. P1 is the headless Prefill rank."
msgstr "将以下 `run_p1.sh` 保存到 P1。P1 是无头 Prefill rank。"

msgid "Start the two Prefill ranks with the shared launcher:"
msgstr "使用共享启动器启动两个 Prefill rank："

msgid "**Common Decode template**"
msgstr "**通用 Decode 模板**"

msgid ""
"Save the following `run_d.sh` on D0 and D1. Decode uses\n"
"    `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph mode for the target model and keeps FlashComm1\n"
"    disabled. The node wrappers below provide `LOCAL_IP`."
msgstr ""
"将以下 `run_d.sh` 保存到 D0 和 D1。Decode 对目标模型使用\n"
"    `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 图模式，并保持 FlashComm1\n"
"    禁用。下面的节点包装脚本提供 `LOCAL_IP`。"

msgid "**D0 and D1 wrappers**"
msgstr "**D0 和 D1 包装脚本**"

msgid "Save the following `run_d0.sh` on D0:"
msgstr "将以下 `run_d0.sh` 保存到 D0："

msgid "Save the following `run_d1.sh` on D1:"
msgstr "将以下 `run_d1.sh` 保存到 D1："

msgid ""
"Start four DP8/TP2 engines on each Decode node. `--dp-rank-start` is\n"
"    `0` on D0 and `4` on D1. `--dp-address` is D0's IP on both nodes, and\n"
"    the launcher assigns API ports `9900-9903` on each node."
msgstr ""
"在每个 Decode 节点上启动四个 DP8/TP2 引擎。`--dp-rank-start` 在 D0 上为\n"
"    `0`，在 D1 上为 `4`。`--dp-address` 在两个节点上都是 D0 的 IP，\n"
"    启动器会在每个节点上分配 API 端口 `9900-9903`。"

msgid "**Startup order**"
msgstr "**启动顺序**"

msgid ""
"Start the services in this order: the first node of each group, the\n"
"    remaining nodes, then the proxy."
msgstr ""
"按以下顺序启动服务：每组中的第一个节点、\n"
"    其余节点，然后是代理。"

msgid ""
"1. Complete the container and multi-node communication checks on all\n"
"       four nodes.\n"
"    2. Start P0 with the launcher command below (`--dp-rank-start 0`). P0\n"
"       hosts the Prefill API endpoint and the Prefill DP master.\n"
"    3. Start D0 with its launcher command (`--dp-rank-start 0`). D0 hosts\n"
"       the Decode DP master and four API endpoints.\n"
"    4. After P0 and D0 are ready, start P1 and D1 with their commands\n"
"       (`--dp-rank-start 1` and `--dp-rank-start 4`).\n"
"    5. After all ten engines are ready, start the proxy. Verify each\n"
"       engine first with\n"
"       `curl http://127.0.0.1:<port>/v1/models`, then send requests to\n"
"       `<PREFILL_NODE0_IP>:8081`."
msgstr ""
"1. 在所有四个节点上完成容器和多节点通信检查。\n"
"    2. 使用下面的启动器命令（`--dp-rank-start 0`）启动 P0。P0\n"
"       承载 Prefill API 端点和 Prefill DP master。\n"
"    3. 使用其启动器命令（`--dp-rank-start 0`）启动 D0。D0 承载\n"
"       Decode DP master 和四个 API 端点。\n"
"    4. 在 P0 和 D0 就绪后，使用各自的命令\n"
"       （`--dp-rank-start 1` 和 `--dp-rank-start 4`）启动 P1 和 D1。\n"
"    5. 在所有十个引擎就绪后，启动代理。首先使用\n"
"       `curl http://127.0.0.1:<port>/v1/models` 验证每个\n"
"       引擎，然后向 `<PREFILL_NODE0_IP>:8081` 发送请求。"

msgid "**Deploy the PD proxy**"
msgstr "**部署 PD 代理**"

msgid ""
"Open another terminal in one Prefill container and start the\n"
"    [load-balancing proxy](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py).\n"
"    The proxy listens on port `8081`, sends Prefill requests to the P0 API\n"
"    endpoint, and forwards Decode work to the eight Decode endpoints."
msgstr ""
"在一个 Prefill 容器中打开另一个终端并启动\n"
"    [负载均衡代理](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py)。\n"
"    该代理监听端口 `8081`，将 Prefill 请求发送到 P0 API\n"
"    端点，并将 Decode 工作转发到八个 Decode 端点。"

msgid "**Key parameter differences from the A3 layout**"
msgstr "**与 A3 布局的关键参数差异**"

msgid ""
"- DP2/TP8 on Prefill and DP8/TP2 on Decode are the validated A2\n"
"      layouts. Their products must be 8 on each A2 node instead of 16 on\n"
"      each A3 node.\n"
"    - P0 and P1 use the shared launcher with one local DP rank each. P0\n"
"      exposes the Prefill API with `--api-server-count 1`; P1 is headless.\n"
"      D0 and D1 each run four API-serving DP8/TP2 engines through their\n"
"      node-specific wrapper scripts.\n"
"    - `kv_connector_extra_config` enables `use_ascend_direct` for direct\n"
"      NPU-to-NPU KV transfer and declares the actual Prefill and Decode\n"
"      `{dp_size, tp_size}` topology. The declared values must match the\n"
"      real deployment.\n"
"    - Prefill uses `--max-num-seqs 64` and `--max-num-batched-tokens 8192`\n"
"      with `--enforce-eager`; Decode uses `--max-num-seqs 32` and\n"
"      `--max-num-batched-tokens 1024` with `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph mode.\n"
"      Both roles run with `--async-scheduling`.\n"
"    - Both roles rely on model runner V1 via\n"
"      `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0`, consistent with the other tabs in\n"
"      this guide. `VLLM_HOST_IP` advertises the IP that peers use to\n"
"      reach each engine for KV transfer.\n"
"    - MTP speculative decoding uses three speculative tokens on A2.\n"
"      `enforce_eager: true` keeps the MTP draft model in eager mode, as in\n"
"      the other tabs of this guide.\n"
"    - `HCCL_HOST_SOCKET_PORT_RANGE` and `HCCL_NPU_SOCKET_PORT_RANGE` on\n"
"      Decode reserve a disjoint 100-port window per DP rank (starting at\n"
"      `60000 + rank * 100`). When several engines share one node, these\n"
"      ranges prevent the HCCL host-side sockets from silently sharing\n"
"      ports across ranks, which can block engine startup.\n"
"    - The remaining timeout and runtime variables\n"
"      (`VLLM_EXECUTE_MODEL_TIMEOUT_SECONDS`, `HCCL_EXEC_TIMEOUT`,\n"
"      `HCCL_CONNECT_TIMEOUT`, `VLLM_RPC_TIMEOUT`, `OMP_PROC_BIND`,\n"
"      `OMP_NUM_THREADS`) are the validated A2 startup defaults for this\n"
"      model size; keep them unless your environment requires different\n"
"      values.\n"
"    - `HCCL_IF_IP` and all socket interface variables must select the\n"
"      service network used by the configured node IPs. The DP RPC,\n"
"      engine, Mooncake, and proxy ports must be allowed by the host\n"
"      firewall."
msgstr ""
"- Prefill 使用 DP2/TP8，Decode 使用 DP8/TP2，这是经过验证的 A2\n"
"      布局。其 products 在每个 A2 节点上必须为 8，而不是每个 A3 节点上的 16。\n"
"    - P0 和 P1 使用共享启动器，各自拥有一个本地 DP rank。P0\n"
"      通过 `--api-server-count 1` 暴露 Prefill API；P1 为无头模式。\n"
"      D0 和 D1 各自通过其节点专属的包装脚本运行四个提供 API 服务的 DP8/TP2 引擎。\n"
"    - `kv_connector_extra_config` 启用 `use_ascend_direct` 以实现直接的\n"
"      NPU 到 NPU KV 传输，并声明实际的 Prefill 和 Decode\n"
"      `{dp_size, tp_size}` 拓扑。声明的值必须与\n"
"      实际部署一致。\n"
"    - Prefill 使用 `--max-num-seqs 64` 和 `--max-num-batched-tokens 8192`\n"
"      并配合 `--enforce-eager`；Decode 使用 `--max-num-seqs 32` 和\n"
"      `--max-num-batched-tokens 1024` 并采用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 图模式。\n"
"      两种角色均以 `--async-scheduling` 运行。\n"
"    - 两种角色均通过\n"
"      `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0` 依赖模型运行器 V1，与本指南中的其他标签页\n"
"      保持一致。`VLLM_HOST_IP` 通告对等方用于\n"
"      访问各引擎以进行 KV 传输的 IP。\n"
"    - MTP 投机解码在 A2 上使用三个投机 token。\n"
"      `enforce_eager: true` 使 MTP 草稿模型保持 eager 模式，与\n"
"      本指南的其他标签页一致。\n"
"    - Decode 上的 `HCCL_HOST_SOCKET_PORT_RANGE` 和 `HCCL_NPU_SOCKET_PORT_RANGE`\n"
"      为每个 DP rank 预留一个互不重叠的 100 端口窗口（起始于\n"
"      `60000 + rank * 100`）。当多个引擎共享一个节点时，这些\n"
"      范围可防止 HCCL 主机侧套接字在各 rank 之间静默共享\n"
"      端口，从而避免阻塞引擎启动。\n"
"    - 其余超时和运行时变量\n"
"      （`VLLM_EXECUTE_MODEL_TIMEOUT_SECONDS`、`HCCL_EXEC_TIMEOUT`、\n"
"      `HCCL_CONNECT_TIMEOUT`、`VLLM_RPC_TIMEOUT`、`OMP_PROC_BIND`、\n"
"      `OMP_NUM_THREADS`）是该模型规模下经过验证的 A2 启动默认值；\n"
"      除非你的环境需要不同的值，否则请保持不变。\n"
"    - `HCCL_IF_IP` 以及所有套接字接口变量必须选择\n"
"      已配置节点 IP 所使用的服务网络。DP RPC、\n"
"      引擎、Mooncake 和代理端口必须被主机\n"
"      防火墙允许。"

msgid "### 5.3 Multi-Node Colocated Deployment"
msgstr "### 5.3 多节点混布部署"

msgid "### 5.4 Prefill-Decode Disaggregation with KV Cache Pool"
msgstr "### 5.4 使用 KV Cache Pool 的 Prefill-Decode 分离部署"

msgid ""
"This section documents Mooncake KV Cache Pool deployment for both Atlas 800\n"
"A3 and Atlas 800 A2. Select the platform subsection that matches the PD\n"
"topology in [Section 5.2](#52-1p1d-pd-disaggregated-deployment). Both\n"
"platforms use `MultiConnector` to combine two connectors:"
msgstr ""
"本节介绍适用于 Atlas 800\n"
"A3 和 Atlas 800 A2 的 Mooncake KV Cache Pool 部署。请选择与\n"
"[第 5.2 节](#52-1p1d-pd-disaggregated-deployment)中 PD 拓扑相匹配的平台子章节。两种\n"
"平台均使用 `MultiConnector` 组合两个连接器："

msgid ""
"- `MooncakeConnectorV2` continues to transfer KV cache from Prefill to Decode.\n"
"- `AscendStoreConnector` lets Prefill look up, load, and save cached prefixes\n"
"  in the Mooncake KV Cache Pool, reducing repeated Prefill computation."
msgstr ""
"- `MooncakeConnectorV2` 继续将 KV cache 从 Prefill 传输到 Decode。\n"
"- `AscendStoreConnector` 使 Prefill 能够在 Mooncake KV Cache Pool 中查找、加载和保存\n"
"  缓存的 prefix，从而减少重复的 Prefill 计算。"

msgid ""
"Decode receives KV through the P→D connector. Its pool connector keeps\n"
"`consumer_is_to_load` and `consumer_is_to_put` disabled, and contributes no\n"
"pool memory. This configuration reuses pooled prefixes among Prefill engines\n"
"with the same TP8 layout; it does not load TP8 pool entries directly into TP1\n"
"Decode engines."
msgstr ""
"Decode 通过 P→D 连接器接收 KV。其 pool 连接器保持\n"
"`consumer_is_to_load` 和 `consumer_is_to_put` 为禁用状态，并且不贡献\n"
"pool 内存。此配置在具有相同 TP8 布局的 Prefill 引擎之间复用池化的\n"
"prefix；它不会将 TP8 pool 条目直接加载到 TP1\n"
"Decode 引擎中。"

msgid ""
"For backend installation, hardware dependencies, memory sizing, eviction,\n"
"and tenant options, refer to the [KV Cache Pool Deployment Guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md)."
msgstr ""
"有关后端安装、硬件依赖、内存规格、驱逐\n"
"和租户选项，请参阅 [KV Cache Pool 部署指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md)。"

msgid ""
"Reuse the A3 DP2/TP8 Prefill and DP16/TP1 Decode topology, launcher, and\n"
"    proxy endpoint mapping from Section 5.2."
msgstr ""
"复用第 5.2 节中的 A3 DP2/TP8 Prefill 和 DP16/TP1 Decode 拓扑、启动器\n"
"    以及代理端点映射。"

msgid "**Prepare the Containers and Mooncake Configuration**"
msgstr "**准备容器和 Mooncake 配置**"

msgid ""
"Install the Mooncake backend according to the KV Cache Pool Deployment Guide.\n"
"    For A3 HCCS pooling, check the HDK, CANN, and LingQu Computing Network\n"
"    requirements in its [Hardware Dependency Quick Reference](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md#ascend_global_resource_config).\n"
"    Add the following mount to the A3 Docker command in Section 4.1 on both nodes:"
msgstr ""
"按照 KV Cache Pool 部署指南安装 Mooncake 后端。\n"
"    对于 A3 HCCS 池化，请查看其 [硬件依赖快速参考](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md#ascend_global_resource_config)\n"
"    中的 HDK、CANN 和灵衢计算网络要求。\n"
"    在两个节点的第 4.1 节 A3 Docker 命令中添加以下挂载："

msgid ""
"Create a separate `mooncake.json` on each node. Replace `<PREFILL_NODE_IP>`\n"
"    with the Prefill node IP used in Section 5.2; Mooncake Master runs on that\n"
"    node at port `50088`. Use the same `tenant_id` on both nodes."
msgstr ""
"在每个节点上创建一个单独的 `mooncake.json`。将 `<PREFILL_NODE_IP>`\n"
"    替换为第 5.2 节中使用的 Prefill 节点 IP；Mooncake Master 在该\n"
"    节点的 `50088` 端口上运行。在两个节点上使用相同的 `tenant_id`。"

msgid "Prefill `mooncake.json`:"
msgstr "Prefill `mooncake.json`："

msgid ""
"`global_segment_size` is registered per worker, not per node. With DP2/TP8,\n"
"    the Prefill node starts 16 workers, so `64GB` per worker reserves `1TB` in\n"
"    total. Adjust this example to the available fabric memory, keeping each\n"
"    non-zero segment size aligned to `1GB`."
msgstr ""
"`global_segment_size` 按 worker 注册，而不是按节点注册。在 DP2/TP8 下，\n"
"    Prefill 节点启动 16 个 worker，因此每个 worker `64GB` 总共预留 `1TB`。\n"
"    请根据可用的 fabric 内存调整此示例，保持每个\n"
"    非零 segment 大小与 `1GB` 对齐。"

msgid "Decode `mooncake.json`:"
msgstr "Decode `mooncake.json`："

msgid "**Add the Pool Environment Variables**"
msgstr "**添加 Pool 环境变量**"

msgid ""
"In both `run_p.sh` and `run_d.sh`, keep the Section 5.2 environment variables\n"
"    and add the following exports before `exec vllm serve`. Replace\n"
"    `<CONFIG_DIRECTORY>` with the absolute directory containing that node's\n"
"    `mooncake.json`."
msgstr ""
"在 `run_p.sh` 和 `run_d.sh` 中，保留第 5.2 节的环境变量，\n"
"    并在 `exec vllm serve` 之前添加以下 export。将\n"
"    `<CONFIG_DIRECTORY>` 替换为包含该节点 `mooncake.json` 的\n"
"    绝对目录。"

msgid ""
"The two nodes must use the same `PYTHONHASHSEED`. For A3 RoCE pooling, use the\n"
"    communication and huge-page settings in the KV Cache Pool Deployment Guide\n"
"    instead of the HCCS fabric-memory exports above."
msgstr ""
"两个节点必须使用相同的 `PYTHONHASHSEED`。对于 A3 RoCE 池化，请使用\n"
"    KV Cache Pool 部署指南中的通信和大页设置，\n"
"    而不是上面的 HCCS fabric 内存 export。"

msgid "**Update the Prefill and Decode Connectors**"
msgstr "**更新 Prefill 和 Decode 连接器**"

msgid ""
"Prefix caching and chunked prefill are enabled by default for this model,\n"
"    so the serving scripts omit their explicit flags. Keep both features\n"
"    enabled. GLM-5.3-Flash has linear-attention state, and `AscendStoreConnector`\n"
"    requires `mamba_cache_mode=align`; the model configuration selects this mode\n"
"    when prefix caching is enabled. Keep the hybrid KV cache manager enabled\n"
"    and `use_layerwise` disabled for this configuration."
msgstr ""
"此模型默认启用 prefix caching 和 chunked prefill，\n"
"    因此服务脚本省略了它们的显式标志。请保持这两个功能\n"
"    启用。GLM-5.3-Flash 具有线性注意力状态，并且 `AscendStoreConnector`\n"
"    需要 `mamba_cache_mode=align`；当启用 prefix caching 时，\n"
"    模型配置会选择此模式。对于此配置，请保持混合 KV cache 管理器启用，\n"
"    并保持 `use_layerwise` 禁用。"

msgid ""
"Replace the final `--kv-transfer-config` argument in `run_p.sh` with the\n"
"    following fragment. Keep the remaining\n"
"    Prefill flags from Section 5.2.2, including `--max-num-seqs 32`."
msgstr ""
"将 `run_p.sh` 中最后的 `--kv-transfer-config` 参数替换为\n"
"    以下片段。保留第 5.2.2 节中其余的\n"
"    Prefill 标志，包括 `--max-num-seqs 32`。"

msgid ""
"Replace the final `--kv-transfer-config` argument in `run_d.sh` with the\n"
"    following fragment. Keep the remaining Decode flags from Section 5.2.3,\n"
"    including `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph mode and the MTP configuration."
msgstr ""
"将 `run_d.sh` 中最后的 `--kv-transfer-config` 参数替换为以下片段。保留第 5.2.3 节中其余的 Decode "
"标志，包括 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 图模式和 MTP 配置。"

msgid ""
"`$4` is the DP rank passed by `launch_online_dp.py`. Each engine must have a\n"
"    unique `engine_id` and `lookup_rpc_port`; the child connectors inherit the\n"
"    outer `engine_id`. The Prefill lookup values are `37000-37001`, and the\n"
"    Decode lookup values are `37100-37115`. Keep the role-specific Mooncake KV\n"
"    base ports from Section 5.2; its workers and schedulers derive their own\n"
"    ports from the topology."
msgstr ""
"`$4` 是 `launch_online_dp.py` 传入的 DP rank。每个引擎必须具有唯一的 `engine_id` 和 "
"`lookup_rpc_port`；子连接器继承外层的 `engine_id`。Prefill 的 lookup 值为 "
"`37000-37001`，Decode 的 lookup 值为 `37100-37115`。保留第 5.2 节中角色特定的 Mooncake KV "
"基础端口；其 worker 和 scheduler 根据拓扑推导各自的端口。"

msgid "**Start the Services**"
msgstr "**启动服务**"

msgid ""
"Start the services in this order: Mooncake Master → Decode → Prefill → "
"Proxy."
msgstr "按以下顺序启动服务：Mooncake Master → Decode → Prefill → Proxy。"

msgid ""
"1. In a separate terminal in the Prefill container, start Mooncake Master.\n"
"       Ensure port `50088` is reachable from both nodes."
msgstr ""
"1. 在 Prefill 容器中的另一个终端里启动 Mooncake Master。\n"
"       确保两个节点都能访问端口 `50088`。"

msgid ""
"2. Start Decode with the launcher command in Section 5.2.3. Wait until all\n"
"       sixteen Decode engines on ports `9900-9915` are ready.\n"
"    3. Start Prefill with the launcher command in Section 5.2.2. Wait until both\n"
"       Prefill engines on ports `9081-9082` are ready.\n"
"    4. Start the proxy from Section 5.2.4. Send inference requests to\n"
"       `<PREFILL_NODE_IP>:8081` using the examples in Section 6."
msgstr ""
"2. 使用第 5.2.3 节中的启动器命令启动 Decode。等待端口 `9900-9915` 上的全部十六个 Decode 引擎就绪。\n"
"    3. 使用第 5.2.2 节中的启动器命令启动 Prefill。等待端口 `9081-9082` 上的两个 Prefill 引擎就绪。\n"
"    4. 启动第 5.2.4 节中的 proxy。使用第 6 节中的示例向 `<PREFILL_NODE_IP>:8081` 发送推理请求。"

msgid "**Verify KV Cache Reuse**"
msgstr "**验证 KV Cache 复用**"

msgid ""
"Warm up the pool through the proxy with a prompt longer than one cache\n"
"    block, then repeat requests with the same prefix. Check Prefill output for\n"
"    successful pool saves, lookups, loads, and cache hits, and check Decode\n"
"    output for successful P→D transfers."
msgstr ""
"通过 proxy 使用长度超过一个 cache block 的 prompt 预热池，然后使用相同前缀重复发送请求。检查 Prefill "
"输出以确认池保存、lookup、加载和 cache 命中均成功，并检查 Decode 输出以确认 P→D 传输成功。"

msgid ""
"The proxy distributes requests across two Prefill engines. A repeated\n"
"    request can also hit an engine's local prefix cache; confirm pool load/hit\n"
"    information on the other Prefill rank to verify shared pool reuse. Only\n"
"    complete, cacheable blocks are reused, so a partial trailing block can\n"
"    still require computation."
msgstr ""
"proxy 将请求分发到两个 Prefill 引擎。重复的请求也可能命中某个引擎的本地前缀缓存；请在另一个 Prefill rank "
"上确认池加载/命中信息，以验证共享池复用。只有完整的、可缓存的 block 才会被复用，因此末尾不完整的 block 仍可能需要计算。"

msgid ""
"Reuse the `launch_online_dp.py` launcher, the P0/P1 and D0/D1 scripts, the\n"
"    DP2/TP8 Prefill and DP8/TP2 Decode topology, and the proxy configuration from\n"
"    Section 5.2. A2 nodes do not have the A3 HCCS fabric: the\n"
"    pool runs over the A2 RoCE network with the `P2PHANDSHAKE` metadata server\n"
"    and the `ascend` protocol, and the A3 fabric-memory exports do not apply."
msgstr ""
"复用 `launch_online_dp.py` 启动器、P0/P1 和 D0/D1 脚本、DP2/TP8 Prefill 和 DP8/TP2 "
"Decode 拓扑，以及第 5.2 节中的 proxy 配置。A2 节点没有 A3 HCCS fabric：池运行在 A2 RoCE 网络上，使用 "
"`P2PHANDSHAKE` 元数据服务器和 `ascend` 协议，A3 fabric-memory 导出项不适用。"

msgid ""
"For backend installation, memory sizing, eviction, and tenant options, refer\n"
"    to the [KV Cache Pool Deployment Guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md)."
msgstr ""
"有关后端安装、内存规格、驱逐和租户选项，请参阅 [KV Cache Pool "
"部署指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md)。"

msgid "**Prepare the Mooncake Configuration**"
msgstr "**准备 Mooncake 配置**"

msgid ""
"The A2 Docker command in Section 4.1 already mounts `/etc/hccn.conf`.\n"
"    Install the Mooncake backend according to the KV Cache Pool Deployment\n"
"    Guide, then create the Prefill and Decode `mooncake.json` files using the\n"
"    JSON shape shown in the A3 subsection. Set `master_server_address` to\n"
"    `<PREFILL_NODE0_IP>:50088`; Mooncake Master runs in the first Prefill\n"
"    container. `global_segment_size` is registered per worker: with DP2/TP8\n"
"    spread across two Prefill nodes, each node starts 8 workers. The validated\n"
"    example uses `8GB` per worker, a `128GB` pool in total; adjust the\n"
"    per-worker size to the available host memory, keeping each non-zero segment\n"
"    size aligned to `1GB`. Keep `global_segment_size` at `0` in the Decode\n"
"    `mooncake.json`."
msgstr ""
"第 4.1 节中的 A2 Docker 命令已经挂载了 `/etc/hccn.conf`。按照 KV Cache Pool 部署指南安装 "
"Mooncake 后端，然后使用 A3 小节中所示的 JSON 结构创建 Prefill 和 Decode 的 `mooncake.json` 文件。将"
" `master_server_address` 设置为 `<PREFILL_NODE0_IP>:50088`；Mooncake Master "
"运行在第一个 Prefill 容器中。`global_segment_size` 按 worker 注册：在 DP2/TP8 分布在两个 Prefill"
" 节点的情况下，每个节点启动 8 个 worker。经过验证的示例为每个 worker 使用 `8GB`，池总计 "
"`128GB`；请根据可用的主机内存调整每个 worker 的大小，保持每个非零 segment 大小对齐到 `1GB`。在 Decode 的 "
"`mooncake.json` 中将 `global_segment_size` 保持为 `0`。"

msgid ""
"In both `run_p.sh` and `run_d.sh`, keep the Section 5.2 environment\n"
"    variables and add the following exports before `exec vllm serve`. Replace\n"
"    `<CONFIG_DIRECTORY>` with the absolute directory containing that node's\n"
"    `mooncake.json`."
msgstr ""
"在 `run_p.sh` 和 `run_d.sh` 中，保留第 5.2 节的环境变量，并在 `exec vllm serve` 之前添加以下导出项。将 "
"`<CONFIG_DIRECTORY>` 替换为包含该节点 `mooncake.json` 的绝对目录。"

msgid ""
"All nodes must use the same `PYTHONHASHSEED`. Do not add the A3\n"
"    `ASCEND_ENABLE_USE_FABRIC_MEM` export; it applies to the A3 HCCS fabric\n"
"    only. The general A2 branch of the KV Cache Pool Deployment Guide also\n"
"    suggests huge pages and `HCCL_INTRA_ROCE_ENABLE`; with the `P2PHANDSHAKE`\n"
"    metadata server and the `ascend` protocol these are not required, and the\n"
"    validated configuration does not set them."
msgstr ""
"所有节点必须使用相同的 `PYTHONHASHSEED`。不要添加 A3 的 `ASCEND_ENABLE_USE_FABRIC_MEM` "
"导出项；它仅适用于 A3 HCCS fabric。KV Cache Pool 部署指南的通用 A2 分支还建议使用 huge pages 和 "
"`HCCL_INTRA_ROCE_ENABLE`；在使用 `P2PHANDSHAKE` 元数据服务器和 `ascend` "
"协议时，这些并非必需，经过验证的配置也未设置它们。"

msgid ""
"Keep prefix caching and chunked prefill enabled. `use_layerwise` must\n"
"    remain `false` for this model: the GLM-5.3-Flash hybrid KV cache contains a\n"
"    non-prefix-cacheable group, and layer-wise pool transfer requires every\n"
"    group to be cacheable, so the pool stores and loads whole segments. No\n"
"    manual `--mamba-cache-mode` flag is needed either: when the connector list\n"
"    contains `AscendStoreConnector`, the engine switches the mamba cache mode to\n"
"    `align` automatically."
msgstr ""
"保持前缀缓存和 chunked prefill 启用。对于此模型，`use_layerwise` 必须保持为 `false`：GLM-5.3-Flash"
" 混合 KV cache 包含一个不可前缀缓存的 group，而 layer-wise 池传输要求每个 group 都可缓存，因此池存储和加载整个 "
"segment。也无需手动设置 `--mamba-cache-mode` 标志：当连接器列表包含 `AscendStoreConnector` "
"时，引擎会自动将 mamba cache 模式切换为 `align`。"

msgid ""
"Replace the final `--kv-transfer-config` argument in `run_p.sh` with the\n"
"    following fragment. Keep the remaining Prefill flags from Section 5.2,\n"
"    including `--max-num-seqs 64`."
msgstr ""
"将 `run_p.sh` 中最后的 `--kv-transfer-config` 参数替换为以下片段。保留第 5.2 节中其余的 Prefill "
"标志，包括 `--max-num-seqs 64`。"

msgid ""
"Replace the final `--kv-transfer-config` argument in `run_d.sh` with the\n"
"    following fragment. Keep the remaining Decode flags from Section 5.2,\n"
"    including `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph mode and the MTP configuration."
msgstr ""
"将 `run_d.sh` 中最后的 `--kv-transfer-config` 参数替换为以下片段。保留第 5.2 节中其余的 Decode "
"标志，包括 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 图模式和 MTP 配置。"

msgid ""
"Both role templates use the launcher DP-rank argument `$4` for the\n"
"    `engine_id` suffix and lookup port. Each engine must have a unique\n"
"    `engine_id` and `lookup_rpc_port`; the child connectors inherit the outer\n"
"    `engine_id`. The Prefill lookup ports are `37000-37001`, and the Decode lookup\n"
"    ports are `37100-37107`. The `prefill` and `decode` topology declared in the\n"
"    `MooncakeConnectorV2` fragment must match the real deployment."
msgstr ""
"两个角色模板都使用启动器 DP-rank 参数 `$4` 作为 `engine_id` 后缀和 lookup 端口。每个引擎必须具有唯一的 "
"`engine_id` 和 `lookup_rpc_port`；子连接器继承外层的 `engine_id`。Prefill 的 lookup 端口为 "
"`37000-37001`，Decode 的 lookup 端口为 `37100-37107`。`MooncakeConnectorV2` 片段中声明的"
" `prefill` 和 `decode` 拓扑必须与实际部署一致。"

msgid ""
"Start the services in this order: Mooncake Master → Decode → Prefill →\n"
"    Proxy."
msgstr ""
"按以下顺序启动服务：Mooncake Master → Decode → Prefill →\n"
"    Proxy。"

msgid ""
"1. In a separate terminal in the first Prefill container, start Mooncake\n"
"       Master with the command from Section 5.4.1.4. Ensure port `50088` is\n"
"       reachable from all four nodes.\n"
"    2. Start D0 and D1 with the launcher commands from Section 5.2\n"
"       (`--dp-rank-start 0` and `4`; four engines per node on ports\n"
"       `9900-9903`). Wait until all eight Decode engines answer\n"
"       `curl /v1/models`.\n"
"    3. Start P0 and P1 with the launcher commands from Section 5.2\n"
"       (`--dp-rank-start 0` and `1`; P0 serves the API endpoint on port\n"
"       `9081`, while P1 is headless). Wait until both engines answer.\n"
"    4. Start the A2 proxy from Section 5.2. Send inference requests to\n"
"       `<PREFILL_NODE0_IP>:8081` using the examples in Section 6."
msgstr ""
"1. 在第一个 Prefill 容器的另一个终端中，使用第 5.4.1.4 节中的命令启动 Mooncake\n"
"       Master。确保端口 `50088` 可从全部四个节点访问。\n"
"    2. 使用第 5.2 节中的启动器命令启动 D0 和 D1\n"
"       （`--dp-rank-start 0` 和 `4`；每个节点四个引擎，端口为\n"
"       `9900-9903`）。等待全部八个 Decode 引擎响应\n"
"       `curl /v1/models`。\n"
"    3. 使用第 5.2 节中的启动器命令启动 P0 和 P1\n"
"       （`--dp-rank-start 0` 和 `1`；P0 在端口\n"
"       `9081` 上提供 API 端点，而 P1 为无头模式）。等待两个引擎均响应。\n"
"    4. 使用第 5.2 节中的 A2 代理启动。使用第 6 节中的示例向\n"
"       `<PREFILL_NODE0_IP>:8081` 发送推理请求。"

msgid ""
"Follow the verification steps in Section 5.4.1.5 through the proxy. The proxy\n"
"    sends requests to the P0 API while the DP group uses both Prefill ranks. A\n"
"    repeated request can hit a local prefix cache, so confirm pool load/hit\n"
"    information on the other Prefill rank to verify shared pool reuse."
msgstr ""
"通过代理按照第 5.4.1.5 节中的验证步骤进行操作。代理\n"
"    将请求发送到 P0 API，而 DP 组使用两个 Prefill rank。\n"
"    重复的请求可能命中本地前缀缓存，因此请确认另一个 Prefill rank 上的\n"
"    池加载/命中信息，以验证共享池复用。"

msgid ""
"Once the selected deployment is ready, query its service endpoint. For the\n"
"1P1D PD deployment, use the Prefill node IP and proxy port `8081`. For a\n"
"single-node or A2 colocated deployment, use the API endpoint exposed by its\n"
"vLLM service."
msgstr ""
"所选部署就绪后，查询其服务端点。对于\n"
"1P1D PD 部署，使用 Prefill 节点 IP 和代理端口 `8081`。对于\n"
"单节点或 A2 共置部署，使用其\n"
"vLLM 服务暴露的 API 端点。"

msgid ""
"For detailed instructions, refer to [Using AISBench for accuracy "
"evaluation](../../developer_guide/evaluation/using_ais_bench.md)."
msgstr ""
"有关详细说明，请参阅[使用 AISBench "
"进行精度评估](../../developer_guide/evaluation/using_ais_bench.md)。"
